        "label": "Monthly Income",
        "type": "currency",
        "required": false,
        "storesIn": "monthlyIncome"
      }
    ]
  },
  "compositionRules": [
    "1. Start with the type's dynamicFormSchema, in order.",
    "2. Standard block by sector: employment -> employment block (Sector/Cadre only if requiresSector; Employer only if requiresEmployer; Contract Type/Contract Expiry Date only if requiresContract, inserted after Check Number); business -> business block; other -> other block. A requirement profile with requires_employment_details / requires_business_details also adds that block. If no block applies, use 'other'.",
    "3. Skip a standard field if its key is in omittedStandardFields, OR a configured field has the same key, OR a configured field has the same storesIn.",
    "4. Append the remaining standard fields after the configured ones. All standard fields are optional.",
    "5. Do not render on Step 2 fields whose storesIn is collected elsewhere: dependentsCount, alternativePhone, email, nationality, maritalStatusId, residenceType (Step 1) and bankId, bankBranch, mobileMoneyProviderId, walletNumber (Account Number section).",
    "6. The same composed list is used for rendering AND client-side validation. The server validates the configured dynamicFormSchema; standard fields are nullable columns."
  ],
  "removedQuestions": {
    "allTypes": [
      "bank",
      "account",
      "kadi_muda",
      "mshahara"
    ],
    "note": "Bank/account questions are asked by the Account Number (MNO/BANK) section instead; 'Kadi Muda' and 'Mshahara Anaopokea (TZS)' are not asked.",
    "SEKTA_BINAFSI": [
      "sb_taasisi_other (free-text company name when 'other')",
      "sb_tarehe_ajira (Tarehe ya Kuajiriwa)"
    ],
    "WAJASIRIAMALI": [
      "tin (Namba ya TIN) — the standard 'TIN Number (Optional)' is used instead"
    ],
    "MSTAAFU_UMMA": [
      "mstaafu_check (Check Namba)"
    ]
  },
